.TH LIST_PR_MU2E.SH 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-controlroom t01.00.00" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
list_pr_mu2e.sh \- print the open pull requests of every repository in the Mu2e GitHub organisation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bash bin/list_pr_mu2e.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs
.B gh repo list mu2e \-\-limit 4000
and, for each repository, prints
.B gh pr list \-\-repo
.I repo
in
.BR gh 's
default table format, one block per repository with no header naming
it when stdout is not a terminal.
The file has no shebang and no executable\-specific setup; its header
comment says it "clones" repositories, which it does not.
.PP
A GitHub housekeeping utility, not control\-room software; nothing else in
the suite provides it.
.SH OPTIONS
None; arguments are ignored.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.BR GH_TOKEN ,
.B GH_HOST
and the rest of
.BR gh 's
environment.
.SH EXIT STATUS
The status of the last
.B gh pr list
in the pipeline.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
bash bin/list_pr_mu2e.sh | less
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR list_issues_mu2e.sh (1),
.BR clone_mu2e_repos.sh (1),
.BR gh (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Andrew Norman, Mu2e DAQ group, Fermilab.
